---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: Blog
description: Practical, classroom-tested notes on structured literacy, word mapping, and IEP documentation for interventionists and case managers.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The blog</p>
    <h1>Notes from the intervention room</h1>
    <p class="lead">Practical, no-fluff writing on structured literacy, word mapping, and IEP documentation — the stuff that actually saves you time on Monday.</p>

    {%- if collections.posts | length %}
    <ul class="post-list mt-2">
      {%- for post in collections.posts %}
      <li>
        <a class="card card--lane" style="--accent:{{ site.lanes[post.data.lane].color if post.data.lane else site.colors.navy }}" href="{{ post.url }}">
          {%- if post.data.lane %}<span class="lane-tag" style="color:{{ site.lanes[post.data.lane].color }}">{{ site.lanes[post.data.lane].label }}</span>{%- endif %}
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time></p>
          {%- if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{%- endif %}
          <span class="card-foot"><strong>Read →</strong></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="mt-2">First posts are on the way.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
